muew-preset 2
name Hollow Fifths
category Lead
author MUEW Factory
tags fifths hollow bandpass clean
desc Band-passed fifths with a hollow, reedy tone. Plays chords as single notes.
osc1Shape 3
osc2Shape 3
osc2Detune 7
osc2Level 0.6
filterCutoff 1500
filterReso 1.8
filterMode 1
amp 0.02 0.3 0.8 0.3
mod 0.02 0.5 0.2 0.3
lfo1Rate 4.5
lfo1Shape 0
lfo2 0.35 1
warp1 2 0
warp2 6 0
mseg 1 0 4 0 0 0.15 1 0.55 -0.3 1 0
routes 8
route 1 2 1.5
route 0 0 0.1
route 5 2 3
route 6 5 0.7
route 6 6 0.7
route 7 4 4
route 8 1 0.3
route 8 3 0.25
chorus 0 0.6 6 15 0.35
delay 1 0.36 0.48 0.4 0.25
reverb 1 0.5 0.4 0.2
